{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-01T18:18:18.384Z","data":{"text":"Both the task verify and the proposal verify (`pnpm verify`) pass.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented `osq query [select] --json` within scope:\n\n- **`src/core/report/query-run.ts`** (new) — `runQuery` prints the table list without a statement, otherwise validates the SQL on a schema-only in-memory database first, then builds the real history tables via `buildHistoryTables`, runs the statement under a `setAuthorizer` that allows only `SQLITE_SELECT`, `SQLITE_READ` of the five `HISTORY_TABLES`, `SQLITE_FUNCTION`, and `SQLITE_RECURSIVE`, and closes the database. Refusals (writes, pragma, attach, unknown table, second statement) throw `QueryError` with the cause plus the full table list. Text output is tab-separated with `\\n` for newlines and empty nulls; `--json` yields an array of objects; project root becomes `.` and home `~`.\n- **`src/cli/query.ts`** (new) — `registerQueryCommand` registers `query [select]` with `--json`; a `QueryError` becomes `CommandError`.\n- **`src/cli/index.ts`** — two lines: import and registration.\n- **`tests/query-command.test.ts`** (new) — covers select, join, `WITH`, `--json`, null, newline/path rewriting, no-statement listing, and all eight refusals (non-zero exit, table list present, every project file byte-identical).\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/134-agents-query-osq/.run/results/2.md`."}}
